			<NodeLabel AttachedTo="70" Bounds="865 228 106 18" Id="71" IsReadOnly="True" Visible="False" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/PlatformFramework">
				<p.Text>IListBar properties</p.Text>
			</NodeLabel>
			<Comment Bounds="785 230 205 55" Id="74" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"Change the ListBar to display the\nSequence Files page and show\nthe appropriate tabs in the tab\ncontrol."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
			<Comment Bounds="470 10 385 108" Id="75" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"The Application Manager generates the DisplaySequenceFile event\nwhen TestStand opens a sequence file. The user interface can\nthen set this sequence file to be the current sequence file held by\nthe SequenceFileView Manager. It can also update its controls\nappropriately.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it is an ActiveX\nevent callback VI."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
